{
  "file_id": "3544",
  "text_count": 264,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������How far do we have to keep going?",
      "_offset": 4555,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Until we're somewhere Etemon can't\nreach.",
      "_offset": 4597,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "So where's that?",
      "_offset": 4639,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Whew...it's so hot.",
      "_offset": 4656,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Keep yourselves together, guys.\nWe've got a Crest now, right?",
      "_offset": 4676,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Yeah, but...are we even sure we\ncan use it to make the Digimon\nevolve?",
      "_offset": 4738,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "They can! Right, Agumon?",
      "_offset": 4809,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 4834,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Stay sharp! You're the only one\nhere who can evolve any further.",
      "_offset": 4842,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 4907,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "All right! Okay, guys, cheer up!",
      "_offset": 4915,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "cheer up!",
      "_offset": 4948,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "cheer up!",
      "_offset": 4958,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 4968,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "It's an oasis!",
      "_offset": 4976,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "We can finally rest.",
      "_offset": 4991,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Look, there's fruit!",
      "_offset": 5012,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "You're right, wow!",
      "_offset": 5033,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Perfect! Let's take a break here.",
      "_offset": 5052,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I guess there's nothing else we\ncan do, so we'll take a break!",
      "_offset": 5086,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "I should collect some food for\nnow...",
      "_offset": 5149,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It's probably dangerous\nto go off by myself.",
      "_offset": 5187,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "We're so unlucky...Etemon had to\nfind us just when we'd made it to\nServer Continent.",
      "_offset": 5232,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "The sheer scope of Etemon's power\nthrew us for a loop, and now\neveryone's too scared.",
      "_offset": 5317,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Tai, can you let me inspect\nyour Crest later? Maybe I can\nfigure something out.",
      "_offset": 5403,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "All right, I'll leave it to you!",
      "_offset": 5486,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Let me think about it a bit more.",
      "_offset": 5519,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "All right, I'll leave it to you!",
      "_offset": 5553,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "If I figure out the relationship\nbetween the Tag and Crest, I can\nlearn how Digimon evolve further.",
      "_offset": 5586,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Yeah, right now we're depending on\nthis Crest.",
      "_offset": 5686,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Let me think about it a bit more.",
      "_offset": 5733,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Tai, right now we don't know\nanything about this Crest...",
      "_offset": 5767,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I know! But if I don't have the\nCrest at a time when we need it,\nAgumon won't be able to evolve...",
      "_offset": 5828,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "_offset": 5927,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "There's food scattered in the\nbushes, but it looks like they\ngrow in small portions.",
      "_offset": 5937,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "I wish we could have stayed in the\nKoromon village, just for a bit\nlonger...",
      "_offset": 6022,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Gomamon! If you swim in the oasis,\nwe can't drink from it!",
      "_offset": 6099,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Don't worry, I like being clean!",
      "_offset": 6158,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "That's not the problem...",
      "_offset": 6191,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Gomamon, how long are you gonna\nkeep swimming?",
      "_offset": 6217,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hey, hey, Tokomon! How come the\nonly water around here is at the\noasis?",
      "_offset": 6264,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Hmm, I dunno. Maybe you should ask\nIzzy?",
      "_offset": 6336,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Okay! Let's go ask him together!",
      "_offset": 6382,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I hope Tokomon evolves soon.",
      "_offset": 6415,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yeah! I'm really trying my best to\nprotect you.",
      "_offset": 6444,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Obtained DigiMelon!",
      "_offset": 6492,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Huh, so there's real food here!\nMaybe there's more elsewhere.",
      "_offset": 6512,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Okay, good, good. Let's keep\nlooking.",
      "_offset": 6574,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "We found a lot of food.",
      "_offset": 6612,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Yeah, this'll be enough!",
      "_offset": 6636,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Hey, Izzy. How do you think\nwe're supposed to evolve our\nDigimon to the next level?",
      "_offset": 6661,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Evolving...considering what we've\nseen before, it seems like energy\nis necessary.",
      "_offset": 6750,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Energy?",
      "_offset": 6832,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Evolved Digimon need a large\namount of energy.",
      "_offset": 6840,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I see...",
      "_offset": 6887,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "And there are many cases in which\nDigimon have evolved when their\npartners were in danger...",
      "_offset": 6896,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Energy and danger, huh.",
      "_offset": 6989,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Agumon, I'm stuffing you with food!",
      "_offset": 7013,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "What do you think, guys?",
      "_offset": 7049,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Eh?! But that's all the food we\njust gathered!",
      "_offset": 7074,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "It's the only way! You're the only\none who can beat Etemon!",
      "_offset": 7121,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "What should we do...",
      "_offset": 7181,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "We can't stop him.",
      "_offset": 7202,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "There's still a lot we don't know, \nand it doesn't look like the \nDigimon know any more than we do.",
      "_offset": 7221,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "And we don't know what the Crests\ndo to make them evolve.",
      "_offset": 7321,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "There's no use in rushing to\nfigure it out.",
      "_offset": 7379,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "I mean, shouldn't we try out the\nthings we *do* know?",
      "_offset": 7423,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Try?",
      "_offset": 7477,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "I can't eat any more! Bleh...",
      "_offset": 7482,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "No! Everyone gave you their food\nbecause they're looking forward to\nyour evolution!",
      "_offset": 7512,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 7596,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "My share of food...",
      "_offset": 7604,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "But we can't evolve to the next\nlevel, so...",
      "_offset": 7624,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "That's why both of us have to do\nour best!",
      "_offset": 7669,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "I feel bad for Agumon...",
      "_offset": 7712,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Yeah, it's like Tai's pushing\nAgumon into a corner.",
      "_offset": 7737,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Tai was always kind to us\njuniors in club, but...",
      "_offset": 7792,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Even when he seemed to be just\nrushing into things, he would\nusually consider his surroundings.",
      "_offset": 7845,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Huh...that's a surprise.",
      "_offset": 7941,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Now that he's got that Crest,\nsomething about him seems to have\nchanged.",
      "_offset": 7966,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 8039,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "What's wrong, Joe?",
      "_offset": 8043,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "My Tag's reacting to something!",
      "_offset": 8062,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "...! There's a building over\nthere!",
      "_offset": 8094,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "The Crest must be in there. Let's\ngo!",
      "_offset": 8130,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 8168,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Whoa!",
      "_offset": 8174,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Are you okay? Joe!",
      "_offset": 8180,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Ow, ow. Pesky cable!",
      "_offset": 8199,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Huh? Why's there a cable here?",
      "_offset": 8220,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Huh? Why's there a cable here?",
      "_offset": 8251,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Meanwhile, while the Chosen\nChildren were tracking the Crest\ndown...",
      "_offset": 8282,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Ghigi!!",
      "_offset": 8351,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "What's wrong, Lord Etemon?",
      "_offset": 8359,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Something got caught in the\nnetwork.",
      "_offset": 8386,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Where?",
      "_offset": 8423,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "The Colosseum, the one where I\nhold my yearly concert.",
      "_offset": 8430,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Huh? That's pretty far from there.",
      "_offset": 8485,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "But I've got an interesting show\nset up there. Ghighighi!",
      "_offset": 8520,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "When you look at it up close, it's\npretty old...",
      "_offset": 8578,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "It looks like the Roman Colosseum.",
      "_offset": 8627,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 8662,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "An ancient stadium.",
      "_offset": 8675,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "The Tag's giving off an even\nstronger reaction!",
      "_offset": 8695,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "So the Crest really is in here.\nLet's go in!",
      "_offset": 8743,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 8788,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "There's a soccer goal here!",
      "_offset": 8794,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Okay, let's split up and look for\nthe Crest!",
      "_offset": 8822,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Whew, I can't move anymore. I'm\ngonna rest...",
      "_offset": 8867,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Hey, keep it together!",
      "_offset": 8913,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Let him rest. Our only clue is\nthis Tag, anyway.",
      "_offset": 8936,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Joe and I will go look for the\nCrest, so the rest of you should\ntake a break!",
      "_offset": 8985,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "I'll go with you!",
      "_offset": 9063,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "He said that the tag's our only\nclue, so we wouldn't be of much\nhelp.",
      "_offset": 9081,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
